@format 1
@id split.section-end-set
@title Set section end
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Set the selected section end, or create a section ending at the cursor, and synchronize section state.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split
@flow TB
@related shared.synchronize-sections
@tag section
@tag section-end-set

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow
@alias segment = Cadroue.Core.LSegment

[input] Set section end command <input>
- Receive the section command in the active Split timeline @ flow.PFlowEndSet(...)
> validate

[validate] Validate section request <decision>
- When editing an active section, require a cursor after its start and within the permitted next-section boundary; when no section is active, attempt an end-anchored section creation @ segment.LSegmentEndSet(...)
? "A valid section plan is produced" > apply
? "The request cannot produce a valid plan" > unchanged

[apply] Apply section plan <process>
- Determine whether the operation creates or edits a section @ flow.PFlowEndSet(...)
- Replace the section list and active selection with the returned plan @ flow.PFlowSectionApply(...)
- Record the resulting section boundary @ flow.PFlowSectionRecord(...)
> fragment:shared.synchronize-sections

[unchanged] No change <output>
=The request does not change the section model.
